    "description": "A meteor radar was installed at the South Pole in 2001 and operated intermittently through 2011.  The system provides measurements of the horizontal wind field around 95km in 4 distinct viewing directions.  \nThe data provided in the database are hourly averaged winds at 95km however higher resolution data can be provided upon request.",
